+## Risk Mitigation
+
+| Story | Risk | Mitigation |
+|------|------|------------|
+| S001 | Extracted actions lose their workspace association | Persist and verify `workspace_id` across transcript and proposed-action storage. |
+| S002 | Review exposes or changes another workspace's actions | Scope every read and edit to the active workspace and test the boundary. |
+| S003 | An action is confirmed without an accountable decision | Require explicit confirmation, complete fields, future `due_at`, confirmer, and timestamp. |
+| S004 | Seams pass alone but fail together | Run the end-to-end success and rejection paths across all prior seams. |
